  "notes": "Rapid (Meta's fork of iD) OpenStreetMap editor. The map is the whole UI; chrome is semi-transparent black bars and an icon rail floating over it. Aerial basemap imagery coded as photography. OSM data uses iD's road color coding (orange/yellow/white casings, green outlines for paths, cyan waterways, pink building fills) with white teardrop POI pins and yellow circles labelled with house numbers. Rapid button uses a magenta logo. Tooltips are rich with keyboard shortcut chips."
